        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Mattress prices are less mysterious than the banners suggest. Know the rough band for the type and size you want, wait for one of the holiday windows if you can, and judge every offer against the model's usual price rather than its list price.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Then read the fine print: the trial length and break-in period, return fees, the warranty sag threshold and what voids it. A fair price on a bed you can return or claim on is a better deal than a bigger discount on one you cannot. When you are ready to choose, our <a href="/best-mattress/">best mattress guide</a> has the picks.
          </p>
